{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And their meal-offering and their drink-offerings.</b> Those of the burnt-offering and of the peace-offerings — for they were included [in the general rule], and went out to be judged by a new matter — that they require bread — He restored them to their [original] rule, that they require drink-offerings according to the law of burnt-offering and peace-offerings (Sifrei)." "<b>Unleavened loaves and unleavened wafers.</b> Ten of each kind."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:41.840592127Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}